Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Have you ever wondered why a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.76,0:00:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}cliffhanger in a movie,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}or a single unanswered text message,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}can hijack your entire night of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.78,0:00:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}In nineteen twenty seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}a Russian psychologist named Bluma Zeigarnik
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}sat in a crowded Vienna cafe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}and noticed something strange about the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}waiters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.09,0:00:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}They could memorize complex orders from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.57,0:00:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}twelve different tables without writing a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}single word down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Yet the exact moment a bill
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}was paid,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}their memory of that order vanished
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.49,0:00:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Your brain treats every unfinished task
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.21,0:00:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}like an open browser tab consuming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.59,0:00:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}background memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.84,0:00:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Until the loop is closed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}your subconscious refuses to let it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.03,0:00:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}To beat procrastination,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}never force yourself to finish a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.30,0:00:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}massive project.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Just start for two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}Once the loop is open,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}your own brain will demand that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,60)}you finish it.
